on, a swimming pool, perimeter fencing, playground, spa pool, and the list goes on. For people who love to keep themselves fit and healthy, a fitness corner, putting green, a gymnasium room with all updated pieces of equipment, roof terrace, and tennis courts have also been provided. Furthermore, the units have also been divided into six different layouts, namely, Type A1, Type A2, Type A3, Type B1, Type C1, and Type C2. Each residential unit has been decorated using high-quality interiors with pre-approved air-conditioners. Similarly, each bathroom has also been provided with a hot water supply and shower screens. Besides this, an intercom has been provided to each residential unit for added security which is then directly connected to the security system. While the sub-sale price of the units can vary from RM 899,999-RM 1,750,000, the rental charges, however, remain between RM 1-RM 1,068.Project Name: Westside IIIConfiguration: 469 residential unitsThe following developments are in the same neighbourhood as Westside III:The Westside OneOne Central Park @ Desa ParkCityThe Westside IIThe Northshore GardensThe BreezeWay Garden Condo\n\n\n4.8 3 Ulasan\n\nWei Chuen Pua IQI REALTY SDN. BHD. [ E (1) 1584 ]\n\nWhatsApp\n\nImage\n\nPapar nombor telefon\n\nImage\n\nHantar Pertanyaan\n\nDengan teruskan, anda setuju dengan Terma & Dasar Privasi\n\n##### Soalan Lazim\n\n##### Berapakah kos untuk membeli hartanah di Desa Parkcity, Kuala Lumpur?\n\nSeunit di Desa Parkcity, Kuala Lumpur dijual pada harga RM 749,000.\n\n##### Adakah terdapat keselamatan di Westside Three?\n\nYa (Keselamatan 24 jam).\n\n##### Dimanakah lokasi unit ini?\n\nJalan Residen Utama, Desa Parkcity, Kuala Lumpur.\n\n##### Berapakah anggaran bayaran bulanan pinjaman bagi seunit di Westside Three?\n\nAnggaran bayaran bulanan pinjaman ialah RM 3,141 / bulanan.\n\n##### Bilakah unit ini disiapkan?\n\nTarikh siap adalah pada Mei 2019.-------------------------------------------------------------------------------